#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial: experiment matrices from the CLI"
msgstr "教程：用 CLI 跑实验矩阵"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:6
msgid ""
"Managing one Python script per experiment becomes impractical as the number of experiments grows. The fl-sim command line interface runs a whole **experiment matrix** from a single YAML file: the "
"grid of configurations is described once, and the CLI expands and executes every combination. This tutorial builds a four-run matrix on synthetic data and shows where the results are written."
msgstr "随着实验数量增长，为每个实验单独编写 Python 脚本将变得难以管理。fl-sim 命令行接口能用单个 YAML 文件运行一整个 **实验矩阵** ：配置网格只需描述一次，CLI 负责展开并执行每个组合。本教程在合成数据上构建一个四次运行的矩阵，并展示结果的写入位置。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:13
msgid "The YAML syntax reference lives in :doc:`cli`; this page is the workflow narrative. Prerequisites: :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment`."
msgstr "YAML 语法参考见 :doc:`cli` ；本页讲的是工作流程。前置阅读：:doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:17
msgid "The matrix file"
msgstr "矩阵文件"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:19
msgid "Here is the complete config for this tutorial (``example-configs/fedsynthetic-demo.yml``):"
msgstr "本教程的完整配置如下（``example-configs/fedsynthetic-demo.yml`` ）："

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:25
msgid "Three sections matter:"
msgstr "三个关键部分："

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:27
msgid "``strategy.matrix`` — the grid. Every combination of the listed values is run once: 2 sampling ratios × 2 seeds = 4 experiments."
msgstr "``strategy.matrix``——网格。列出的值每个组合各跑一次：2 个采样比例 × 2 个种子= 4 个实验。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:29
msgid ""
"``${{ matrix.<key> }}`` — interpolation. Wherever this pattern appears, the CLI substitutes the current combination's value. ``seed`` sits at the top level, so it seeds the dataset *and* the server "
"config of that run."
msgstr "``${{ matrix.<key> }}``——插值。该模式出现之处，CLI 都会代入当前组合的值。``seed`` 位于顶层，因此它同时为该次运行的数据集 *和* 服务器配置设定种子。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:33
msgid ""
"everything else — ``algorithm`` (name plus server/client configs), ``dataset``, ``model`` — is exactly the config you would pass in Python, per :doc:`quickstart`, just spelled as YAML. Dataset-"
"specific constructor arguments (``alpha``, ``beta``, ``iid``, ``num_clients`` for :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic`) are passed straight through."
msgstr ""
"其余部分—— ``algorithm`` （名字加服务器/客户端配置）、 ``dataset`` 、 ``model`` ——与你在 Python 里传入的配置（见 :doc:`quickstart` ）完全一致，只是改写成 YAML。数据集各自的构造参数（ :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic` 的 "
"``alpha`` 、 ``beta`` 、 ``iid`` 、 ``num_clients`` ）原样透传。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:41
msgid "Running the matrix"
msgstr "运行矩阵"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:47
msgid "The four runs execute in sequence, each logging its combination (``ratio=0.5 seed=0``, ...). The total time is a few seconds; nothing is downloaded."
msgstr "四次运行依次执行，各自记录自己的组合（ ``ratio=0.5 seed=0`` 等）。总耗时数秒，无下载。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:52
msgid "Results location"
msgstr "结果位置"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:54
msgid ""
"All runs write into ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/fedsynthetic-demo/`` (the ``log_dir`` of this config). Per run you get one ``.txt`` and one ``.json`` log — the same files :doc:`quickstart` described — "
"plus one ``config.json`` holding the exact server/client configs of the most recent run (a previous ``config.json`` is rotated to ``config.json.bak``)."
msgstr ""
"所有运行都写入 ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/fedsynthetic-demo/``（本配置的 ``log_dir`` ）。每次运行各有一份 ``.txt`` 与一份 ``.json`` 日志——即 :doc:`quickstart` 描述过的那些文件——另有一份 ``config.json`` 保存最近一次运行的确切服务器/客户端配置（已有的 "
"``config.json`` 会被轮转为 ``config.json.bak`` ）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:61
msgid ""
"One detail matters as soon as several runs finish within the same minute: log file names carry a timestamp **plus the run's ``tag``**. Without a distinct tag per matrix combination, identically "
"named logs overwrite one another. This is the purpose of the ``tag: ratio_${{ ... }}_seed_${{ ... }}`` line in the config above: every matrix arm receives its own tag."
msgstr "当多次运行在同一分钟内结束时，一个细节便变得重要：日志文件名带有时间戳 **以及该运行的 ``tag``** 。若每个矩阵组合没有独特的 tag，同名的日志会互相覆盖。上面配置中的 ``tag: ratio_${{ ... }}_seed_${{ ... }}`` 一行正是为此：每个矩阵分支都有自己的 tag。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:68
msgid "Beyond serial execution"
msgstr "超越串行执行"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:70
msgid ""
"Long experiment matrices benefit from more than one process. The ``strategy`` section also accepts parallel options (``n_parallel``, or a ``parallel: {mode: parallel_task, num_workers: N}`` block) "
"that dispatch matrix arms to worker processes — see ``example-configs/multiprocessing-demo.yml`` for a complete example, and :doc:`parallel_execution` for the in-process executor backend that "
"parallelizes *within* a single run. The two are orthogonal: process-level parallelism across matrix arms, executor-level parallelism across clients."
msgstr ""
"由长时间实验组成的矩阵需要不止一个进程。 ``strategy`` 节还接受并行选项（ ``n_parallel``，或 ``parallel: {mode: parallel_task, num_workers: N}`` 块），把矩阵分支派发给工作进程——完整示例见 ``example-configs/multiprocessing-demo.yml``；进程内把 *单次运行* "
"的客户端并行化的执行器后端见 :doc:`parallel_execution` 。两者正交：进程级并行作用于矩阵分支之间，执行器级并行作用于客户端之间。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:80
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:82
msgid ":doc:`cli` — the full YAML syntax reference and CLI options."
msgstr ":doc:`cli`——完整的 YAML 语法参考与 CLI 选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:83
msgid ":doc:`parallel_execution` — speed up each individual run."
msgstr ":doc:`parallel_execution`——加速每一次单独的运行。"

